Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.12,0:00:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs15\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord1.5\pos(256.8,13.333)}Human-Faced Dog Update, datsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.88,0:00:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, Squid really messed up this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.96,0:00:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.44,0:00:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy works way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? \NWhy'd you tell me to come to this vacant lot out of nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a tutoring part-time job coming up, \Nso I don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Squid, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is me, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.41,0:00:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,For someone like me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.05,0:00:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been lacking sleep lately, and the other day I was so busy \NI couldn't tell if I was becoming a tutor or a dog at a dog café, 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.23,0:00:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and this might have been taken around then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.56,0:00:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If people find out the human-faced dog's true identity is an alien, \Nwe won't be able to stay on Earth anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.24,0:00:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.48,0:00:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, this human-faced dog is a bit outdated, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.56,0:00:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Human-faced dogs need an update to \Nmatch the times too, tsun-yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.76,0:00:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,An update?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.70,0:00:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about this? \NI based it on a trendy Samoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I kind of like it better when the face stays a Samoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too, tsun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, \Nisn't it not a human-faced dog anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.34,0:01:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.07,0:01:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Though if we're gonna do it, \Nwe should at least reach that level as animals, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.59,0:01:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That level?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.51,0:01:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Becoming an animal-shaped biscuit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.07,0:01:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It says "Human Festival" on it, tsun-yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.51,0:01:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The text will just get licked off anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.44,0:01:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.39,0:01:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Figuring out how to express a human-faced dog \Nthrough silhouettes is our future challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.67,0:01:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where the product development team \Ngets to show off their skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.91,0:01:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs48\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord1.5\pos(190.4,60.444)}PLEASE!
